  "description": "Plus, two stocks I bought this week and when I’m looking to make a move on bonds.",
  "body_html": "<h4><strong>Market has been recovering substantially!</strong></h4><p>Our best stock hit new all time highs this week, pushing profits to over 40%. The silver mining stocks have been holding their ground. And we had the largest ever review of Midweek movers, with 52 stocks going in, and 2 coming out, both of which I purchased this week. These are kind of hard to ignore when the average Midweek Mover stock has made 25.9% this year, and over 75% of them are still up significantly today.</p><p>As always, anything could happen in the market at any given time. And I am more than cognizant about the negative headlines. But just remind yourself: mainstream media is in the business of clicks and views for advertisements…not in the business of making you money. Fearful headlines, though there are elements of truth to them, typically do not aim to actually help investors. Ignore the news! Trend is up.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, worry not, all of them below are still relevant. <em><strong>Never</strong></em> feel like you have to catch every post at the exact moment. I invest and trade with you all in mind, knowing that you have busy lives. You never need to be “first” to a post. This is one of many reasons I do not day or short term trade.</p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/52-stocks-went-in-these-2-came-out?r=4z8lgl\">Two Stocks I Bought From Midweek Movers (click here)</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/when-should-you-buy-tlt?r=4z8lgl\">When Should We Make A Move On Bonds?</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/bitcoin-is-bullish-so-why-wont-i?r=4z8lgl\">Why I Won’t Buy Microstrategy Stock</a></h4><p>Make sure you take some time off, away from the charts. Do something fun. This is so important, to stay fresh. If you come in Monday, grumpy and tired, you are more likely to make poorer decisions. If you ever have questions, feel free to tag me <em>during market hours</em> in the<strong> <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a></strong>. Always happy to explain some of the crazy 🤪 things I say on the internet. We have an incredibly collaborative group of investors and traders, and we all focus on helping each other. </p><p>I’ll see you Monday, and thanks for stopping by!</p><h4><strong>If you like this week’s content, please like ❤️and re-stack 🔄 this post! </strong></h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/our-best-stock-just-hit-another-all?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/our-best-stock-just-hit-another-all?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/our-best-stock-just-hit-another-all?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
